+int CvCityAI::swapHigherFoodCitizen(CvCitizensReverseIterator ir, int& iFoodDifference, int iMinDifference, int& iLowestFood, CvCitizensReverseIterator& irLowestFood, CvGovernorWork &governorWork, CvSortedCitizens& governorCitizens)
